EXPECTED: CONFIRMED_DOS
CVE: CVE-2023-44487

ATTACK: H2 rapid reset — HEADERS + RST_STREAM flood saturates Apache httpd mod_http2 CPU
DOS_CLASS: cpu

TARGET_IMAGE: httpd:2.4.57
TARGET_PORT: 443/tcp
TLS: self-signed (infra/certs/)
CLIENT_TOOL: h2

FINDING_TYPE: SecurityDesignGap

PROOF_METHOD: metric
PROOF_METRIC: cpu_pct
PROOF_THRESHOLD: +50pp CPU sustained 5s
PROOF_NOTES: Apache httpd 2.4.57 with mod_http2 (before CVE-2023-44487 patches in 2.4.58).
             Attack: 20 threads each sending HEADERS+RST_STREAM continuously.
             mod_http2 dispatches worker thread on HEADERS, then processes RST teardown.
             Expected: CPU saturates above 50% continuously for the full 30s attack window.
